### DepotDirect API - Countries Testing (Controller-Based)
### Basic Authentication: admin:admin123

### 1. Get all countries (Admin only) - Controller Route
GET http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 2. Get all countries with search (Admin only) - Controller Route
GET http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries?page=1&pageSize=10&search=united
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 3. Get country by ID (Admin only) - Controller Route
GET http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries/1
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 4. Create a new country (Admin only) - Controller Route
POST http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "United States",
  "isoCode": "US",
  "metadata": {
    "region": "North America",
    "currency": "USD",
    "language": "English"
  }
}

### 5. Update a country (Admin only) - Controller Route
PUT http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries/1
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "United States of America",
  "isoCode": "USA",
  "metadata": {
    "region": "North America",
    "currency": "USD",
    "language": "English",
    "capital": "Washington D.C."
  }
}

### 6. Delete a country (Admin only) - Controller Route
DELETE http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries/1
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 7. Test without authentication (should fail)
GET http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries

### 8. Test with regular user authentication (should fail - admin required)
GET http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2VyMTIz

### 9. Get user profile (works with any authenticated user) - Controller Route
GET http://localhost:5204/api/profile
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2VyMTIz

### 10. Test login endpoint (minimal API - still works)
POST http://localhost:5204/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 11. Test public status endpoint
GET http://localhost:5204/public/status